{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23297","headline":"奉和李大夫题新诗二首各六韵 忘筌亭 · 白居易","name":"奉和李大夫题新诗二首各六韵 忘筌亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翠巘公门对，朱轩野径连。\n只开新户牖，不改旧风烟。\n虚室闲生白，高情澹入玄。\n酒容同座劝，诗借属城传。\n自笑沧江畔，遥思绦帐前。\n亭台随处有，争敢比忘筌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}